339 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 114 0 R
/E (Unit Testing using DevOps shows how automated tests can be built into the software delivery process. The calculator application was tested with 8 unit tests that cover normal inputs, boundary values, and error conditions such as division by zero and negative factorial. Each test was executed automatically by the CI pipeline whenever code was pushed, and all tests passed. The project demonstrates that automated unit testing finds defects early, reduces manual effort, gives developers quick feedback, and prevents faulty code from being deployed. Using Git for version control and Docker for a consistent environment makes the process repeatable on any machine. Overall, combining unit testing with DevOps practices leads to higher quality software and faster, safer releases. )
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
