344 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 115 0 R
/E (In the future, this project can be extended with code coverage reports so that untested parts of the code are easy to identify. Integration, system, and performance tests can be added to the pipeline after the unit tests. Static code analysis and security scanning tools such as SonarQube can be included to check code quality and vulnerabilities. The pipeline can also be extended to Continuous Deployment, automatically releasing the Docker image to a cloud platform using Kubernetes, with monitoring tools such as Prometheus and Grafana to track the application after release. Notifications through email or Slack can be added so the team is alerted immediately when a build fails. )
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
